Package: PlotTrellis
Title: Project-Centric EDA Figures for Genome-Aligned Transcriptomics
Version: 1.3.0
Authors@R:
    person("Aleksander", "Pacnik", email = "pacnik.a@wehi.edu.au", role = c("aut", "cre"),
        comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0000-4062-2582"))
Description: Pay the setup once, not per figure. One text file describes your
    experiment. Every gene thereafter is a few clicks in a 'shiny' app or a few
    lines of R from a clean, fair genome-aligned transcriptomics figure, perfect
    for exploring your data. Share the file, and your lab can make their own.
